WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.920
Nothing good will come to
those who don't take action!

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:09.430
Hey, where's Sugisaki?

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.200
I wonder what happened?

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.500
Did he say he'd be late?

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.840
No, he didn't.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.770
Sorry I'm late.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:21.720
What were you doing?
Our meeting's started!

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.910
Before that, I have a request...

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.270
A request?

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.300
You're late <i>and</i>
you want something?

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.910
You're pretty arrogant.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.440
I'm sorry.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.920
You're strangely quick to apologize.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:39.250
There's always a reason
when Key-kun acts like this.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.750
All right, we're not doing anything
important at this meeting, anyway.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.430
Hey, Chizuru! That's my line!

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.900
Calm down, President.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.800
Let's just hear what he has to say.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.710
That's right. So far as
Mafuyu remembers,

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:58.410
he only acts this way for good reasons.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.670
Fine.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.250
Sugisaki, tell us what you want.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.210
Thank you.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.840
With your permission, there's a girl
I'd like allowed to observe...

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.920
or participate... in the
student council today.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.760
What?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:16.790
I think you'll understand
when I introduce her.

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.460
May I let her in?

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.500
She's right outside?

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.500
There's someone here besides us five?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.420
I'm a little nervous.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.470
It's fine.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:28.050
You guys have never met her,

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:30.380
but it's not like you
don't know who she is.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:33.210
You can come in.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.780
Ex-Excuse me!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.710
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.350
I'm sorry for interrupting
your meeting.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.040
No, um...

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.260
Thank you!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.120
I mean... I'll do my best
not to bother anybody.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:35.630
But thank you...
And I won't bother you!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.490
It's all right. Calm down.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.260
I can't do this, brother!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.000
"Brother"?

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:50.300
So this is my stepsister, Ringo.
I know I've told you about her.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.060
Brother...

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.810
Since she's here for a few days,

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:05.790
I wanted to introduce you.

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.720
So cute!

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.230
She's an angel...

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.730
You're so cute!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.350
I'd heard you were cute,
but I didn't realize how cute!

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:17.480
This is bad.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.000
I might be interested in
someone besides Aka-chan.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.030
Wow...

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.280
I want to play dress up.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.740
I want to play dress up with her!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:31.010
I guess because you're his
stepsister, you're not like him.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:35.680
Mafuyu's glad you're not like senpai.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.320
Hey, harem members!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.920
Why are you acting like that?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.040
Isn't this wrong?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.910
For a romantic comedy,
isn't this wrong?

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.590
Okay! From now on, you're the
vice president, Ringo-chan!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.830
A-Am I?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:58.710
Which means... Ringo...
Ringo can stay here, right?

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.970
Thank you! Thank you!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:07.220
Congratulations!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.450
Ringo will do her best!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.720
Welcome, new Vice President!

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:16.220
My harem was stolen
from me in two seconds!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.730
So why did Sugisaki
bring his sister here?

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:21.460
Rub rub.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:25.000
Would you stop rubbing
your cheek against my

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.600
sister's when you talk?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:30.750
Key-kun, the student council doesn't
let people in during its meetings.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.610
Rub rub.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.600
Don't expect me to believe that

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.380
when you're rubbing my
little sister's head.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:41.380
You can't expect us to hold a meeting
like this, squeeze squeeze.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:45.050
Don't squeeze her! She's not fat!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:48.370
That's right. This is
really inappropriate, Ken.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.290
Squeeze squeeze.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:53.970
You guys are even more inappropriate!

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:58.730
Don't look... Don't look
at Ringo, Brother!

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:03.100
My sister... My sister's been tainted!

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.230
That's mean.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.200
It's okay now.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.230
My clothes got messed up.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:15.260
So anyway, Ringo-chan is welcome,
but what brings her here?

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:17.020
Well, you see...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.960
My parents had to come to town,

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.270
and I hadn't seen them in a while.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:26.590
So they brought Ringo, too.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:33.910
I have to go back tonight, but first I
wanted to see my brother...

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.100
And the student council, too.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.320
So I asked him to take me here.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.260
No, President.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:43.850
I just wanted to show off
my cute little sister.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.560
No!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:49.120
This is Ringo's... my... request.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.120
I said that's not true.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.580
What?

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.800
You spoil Ringo too much!

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:55.690
What?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.650
What's wrong with loving
my cute sister?

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.860
Ringo loves her brother, too!

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.310
I know!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.470
So I've decided to do everything
I can to share my love with you.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.990
That makes me very happy...

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.330
I'm glad.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.480
I'm sorry!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:22.410
That's the end of our
meeting for today.

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.950
Thank you for coming.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.520
Thank you.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.520
I'm sorry!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.190
I'm really sorry!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.790
I'm so sorry!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.530
I'm so terribly, terribly, sorry...

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.530
Um, I've been apologizing
for five minutes, now.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.340
Could you forgive us?

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.810
Jeez.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.960
I'm glad you two are on good terms,

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:49.790
but I think you should save
it for when you're alone.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.930
I really am sorry.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.720
Ringo's basically
just here to watch...

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.850
So we can have our meeting.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.290
Fine.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.220
But as punishment, we're sending
you flying into the sky.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:05.480
Chizuru, get the big
balloons and the helium.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:09.370
What? That's fantastical and
at the same time really nasty!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:14.970
Then you'll spend 24 hours dressed like
a bear in the middle of a sauna.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:16.470
Miss President!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.010
What is it, Ringo-chan?

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:23.380
If... If you're going to kill
my brother, kill me, too!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.280
It-It's okay, Ringo-chan.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:31.030
I'm not going to kill him.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.930
Really?

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.210
Yeah. Yeah.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.540
I'm glad.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.410
She's a very naïve girl
in many ways.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.870
She doesn't get jokes.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.530
I-I see.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.570
I'll have to watch what I say.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:52.570
Anyway... Why doesn't everyone
introduce themselves?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:53.900
That's right.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.180
That's a good idea, Ken.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.560
Okay, Ringo.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.040
I think you know from reading my books,

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.580
but this is Shiina Minatsu.

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.570
Hi, Ringo-chan!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.980
I'm Sugisaki Ringo.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.320
Um... How do you do?

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.560
Hi.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.830
And you can speak in Japanese.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:14.660
That's right.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.770
All right.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:16.490
Um...

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.330
Namaste!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.800
I don't know why you switched to
Indian, but nice to meet you.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:25.650
Oh, and you can call me and
my sister by our first names.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.780
Okay, thank you!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.340
Then, Minatsu-san...

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.800
Go home and suck your mom's teat.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:37.850
Wh-What?

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:42.220
I said go home and suck
your mom's teat, Minatsu.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.030
You're provoking me,
knowing what I'm like?

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.130
Right?

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.410
Why are you so mad?

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.740
You don't know why after
what you just said?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.230
It's pretty funny to watch them
misunderstand each other.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.280
Stop them.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.480
She's scared.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.150
Right?

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:02.330
Isn't it cute?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.680
Sadist! Are you intentionally
torturing your sister?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:10.080
How big of a jerk are you?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.490
Oh, fine.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.160
Hey, Ringo.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.490
What did you think that meant?

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:24.240
Um, drink nutritious milk and
be healthy forever, right?

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.000
That's impossibly good willed!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.740
A spell cast by a certain nasty witch

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:35.260
has done very bad things
to her vocabulary.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.280
But she doesn't mean anything by it.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:41.230
I see.

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:43.120
I'm sorry, Ringo-chan!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.940
I'm glad we cleared up
the misunderstanding.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.600
You really are a lily livered bastard!

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:51.680
I can't guess what she means by that,

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.910
but she seems to think
it's quite a compliment!

00:10:54.910 --> 00:11:00.050
But... I still feel so angry!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.910
Anyway, Ringo, on your right
is Shiina Mafuyu-chan.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.280
She's in the same grade as you.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:06.840
I'm Mafuyu.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.050
Nice to meet you.

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.290
I like video games and BL.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.560
I'm Sugisaki Ringo.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.910
Nice to meet you.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.920
I love my brother... and my brother!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.420
Stare...

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.940
What?

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:22.520
Mafuyu thinks you and I

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:25.210
both play the same role
in this anime, kind of.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:28.250
Um, did Ringo say something
she shouldn't have?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.310
That's it!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.200
Like the way you refer to
yourself by your own name,

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.670
and you're very polite...

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.670
And how fragile you seem...
You're just like Mafuyu!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.670
Wh-Why are you acting
like she's a rival?

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.450
I see.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:46.650
You have the same role,
but Ringo-chan does it better.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.940
She's more feminine.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.160
And not into BL.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.690
And she's closer to Ken.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.910
Nobody needs Mafuyu anyway.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.350
She's the type of character
who gets forgotten

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.420
when a new heroine appears.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.050
Um, Mafuyu-san...
Ringo didn't mean that.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:15.110
That kindness just makes the
difference even more obvious.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:19.410
Just sit in Mafuyu's seat.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.620
You can take my place
and nobody will know.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.720
Let's finish the introductions.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.290
Okay, Ringo.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.150
This is Akaba Chizuru-san.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:31.330
Nice to meet you.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:34.130
Hi. Thanks for taking
good care of my brother.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.620
In bed, too.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:36.660
Huh?

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:39.580
Chizuru-san, what are you saying?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.190
Ringo-chan, whenever you're thanked
for taking care of someone,

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.630
add "in bed, too."

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.670
It's more polite that way.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:48.700
All right!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.880
I'll do that from now on.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:50.900
Good.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.510
Not good!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:56.210
Why are you trying to make my
sister's problem even worse?

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.470
I'm sorry.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:01.160
Whenever I see girls like this,
I want to corrupt them.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:04.610
Please keep your poison
away from my sister.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.200
Ringo... Ringo is...

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.000
Ringo is mine!

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:17.730
Cough.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:21.430
Is there anything you want
to ask Chizuru-san, Ringo?

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:26.160
What is it?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.340
Do you...

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.610
Do you like my brother, Akaba-san?

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.320
Do you like him?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:51.810
What are you—

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.810
Of course you do, right?

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:58.550
When I read the books Ken
writes about your meetings,

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:02.320
I realized that everyone here
is friends with my brother,

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:07.330
but you seem to feel
something special for him.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.110
It's not jealousy.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.410
I was just thinking how cute
it is that you love him,

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.070
but you deliberately
give him the cold shoulder.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.700
That's not...

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.620
I... Well...

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.170
I don't of Key-kun as―

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.380
Akaba-san!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.880
If you keep saying stuff like that,

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.850
my brother will never do
anything, because he's dense.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.380
That's right.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:39.420
Yes. I like him. He's my favorite.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.910
I always say that.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:41.870
No!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.120
My brother's so dense, and so kind!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:51.240
You need to break that
wall apart with your love!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.790
If he wasn't like that,
me and Asuka-oneechan

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.190
wouldn't have to work so hard.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:57.780
Fine.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:14:59.660
Key-kun.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.820
I really...

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:04.280
Stop.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:09.230
Why is the relationship between
Sugisaki and Chizuru changing so rapidly?

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.550
It's too fast for me to follow!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:13.460
That's right.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:17.560
I don't want to get in the
way, but this isn't right!

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:20.120
Ringo-san is scary!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:24.820
Her mere existence is a trap
that disrupts people's hearts.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:28.100
I didn't mean what I just said.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:30.440
I was just going along with Ringo-chan.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:32.780
I got to see Key-kun freak out.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.030
It was fun.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:34.710
Yeah.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:37.490
Akaba-san is trying to
hide her feelings again.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.700
Isn't it cute?

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.520
Ringo-chan?

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:43.720
How much do you want?

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:45.690
That wasn't what I meant!

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:46.720
I'm sorry.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.620
Moving on, I don't
think she needs

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:51.230
an introduction, but...

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.430
Lastly, the tiny one is the President.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.060
Hello.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.360
I am God.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.830
Nice to meet you, God!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.530
She didn't object!

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:02.740
She believed me!

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:04.630
I'm so impressed!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.340
You're both God and the
student council president?

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:08.800
That must be a lot of work!

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.980
Yeah, I guess...

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:15.590
Being God must be really hard.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:18.690
Good job creating the Earth!

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:21.990
I don't think anybody's ever
complimented me like that before.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:25.770
Yeah. Making Mt. Fuji
was especially hard.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:28.510
President! You're going along with this?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.420
Was it?

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.770
How did you make Mt. Fuji?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.580
I piled up dirt, I guess.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.500
That's not much of a creation myth.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.960
Piled up dirt, huh?

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.180
That's amazing.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.420
You can keep complimenting me.

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:46.640
Hail God! Hail God!

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.540
By the way, God.

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.430
You can call me "President" if you want.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.100
In that case, President, I have a request.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.290
A request?

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.180
Sort of like a prayer,
like at a shrine for good grades...

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.760
Oh, I can help with that.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:05.880
Leave it to me!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.300
Thank you!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.540
Please help my brother and I become lovers.

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.380
Thank you, President!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:22.820
I was too embarrassed to say it
aloud, but I said it in my heart!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.990
No, you said it aloud!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:29.100
I hope you heard it, God.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.380
Oh yeah. I heard it.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.000
Really?

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.730
You really are amazing, God!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.240
I think you're the amazing
one here, Ringo-chan.

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:45.880
But... If God heard my prayer,

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:49.010
that means it might come true, right?

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.930
Um...

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.260
A wish is...

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.850
If you want a wish to come true,
you have to do the necessary work, first.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:58.250
Yeah.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.250
Yes, that's right!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.120
I'm planning to go after him hard!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:04.890
Hard?

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.290
Ahem.

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:10.000
I think you may not
have to do the work.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.130
They say a watched pot never boils.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.570
I see.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.710
That's right!

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.640
Then I'll wait and believe!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:20.850
Just... Just don't believe too much.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:24.410
There are some things
even God can't do.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.760
And I have to make lots
of people's prayers

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:29.660
come true all by myself, so I'm busy.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.670
It's a hard job.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.540
Yeah, but I enjoy it.

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.340
Maybe I'll make "God" the second thing

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.940
I want to be when I grow up.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.240
Second thing?

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:40.660
Yes.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:46.430
The first thing I want to
be is my brother's wife!

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.170
O-Okay.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:54.460
You're hired as God, Ringo-chan.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.200
Really? Just like that?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.270
I'm so happy!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:00.730
Um, we don't hire married people,

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.610
so you'll have to give
up on your first job.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.520
I'm quitting, then.

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.190
She was God for less than a minute.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.960
This conversation doesn't
make a lot of sense.

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:13.430
You're really dense when
it comes down to it.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.960
Sugisaki!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.340
You tell her, too!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.270
Brothers and sisters can't get married!

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:20.940
Ringo, don't worry.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.940
I'm planning to get the laws changed so

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:27.350
that marriages to sisters and
multiple marriages are both allowed!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.180
Look forward to it!

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.070
Yeah.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.470
Thank you, brother.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.380
What's wrong, President?

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.390
Key-kun, you're very dumb.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.800
Why?

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:44.140
I'm the kind of guy who wants
to do whatever a girl wants!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:44.890
Right?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.530
You're annoying, senpai.

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:49.030
Why is Mafuyu-chan upset, too?

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:51.530
Brother, what's happened to everyone?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.540
I don't know.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.090
Why?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.940
I'm not dense, so why can't
I understand how they feel?

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.410
Thank you.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.570
I'll take my leave, then.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:09.420
Come back sometime, Ringo-chan.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.480
I'd like to introduce
you to my classmates.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.220
Next time we meet, Mafuyu won't lose!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.430
If Key-kun's mean to you, let me know.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:20.930
I'll be one hundred times meaner to him.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.710
Thank you.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.220
Take care, then.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.620
Yes, goodbye!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.070
Thank you.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.940
Did you enjoy the student council?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:31.640
It was great!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:35.580
Everybody's not just pretty,
they're fun and nice, too!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.740
They're my harem, after all.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:43.080
But it didn't seem much
like a harem to me.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:47.050
No, normally it's way crazier!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.800
We didn't do anything
today 'cause it'd be

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.650
too much for your young eyes.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.860
But, well... It's X-rated!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.950
It is, huh?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.870
You're doing lots of naughty things.

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.600
I'm a little shocked.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.570
It's okay, Ringo!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.820
I'm still a dreaming virgin.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.990
"Virgin"?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.610
What's a "virgin"?

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:09.720
Isn't it supposed to be a
big compliment for guys?

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.410
No, a virgin is...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.890
You're explaining what a virgin is

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.080
to your stepsister in a school at dusk?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.150
I think that's grounds for expulsion.

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:21.590
What's wrong?

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.960
Yakiniku.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:28.160
I sure feel like treating
someone to yakiniku tonight!

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:32.770
Especially someone who's older and
works in the education field!

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.140
What's wrong?

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.080
It's okay.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.340
That was the devil that
just walked past.

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:41.690
She won't kill you, will you?

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.030
Don't cry, Ringo!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.450
I'm not going to die.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.450
A scoop!

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:52.110
Sugisaki Ken, participating in illicit
acts with his stepsister at school!

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:53.080
It'll be a hit!

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:56.460
I'll print more issues than
any in our club's history!

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.530
This school has a lot
of mean people in it.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:08.420
It's got a lot of pretty women, so it's
strange you don't like it more.

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.170
But...

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.280
But?

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:14.910
It really is a wonderful place.

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:17.780
It can be difficult, though.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:20.050
You have to bribe people,
and you're in the papers a lot.

00:22:21.490 --> 00:22:25.320
I think it's amazing that
everyone can act like that.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.130
I think it's because the student council

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:32.520
does everything it can
to make this a fun place.

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:35.560
You're paying close
attention, aren't you?

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:40.330
A lot has happened, so I've been
thinking about a lot of things.

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:49.320
Ringo's still jealous that you're
having fun with all these other girls.

00:22:49.710 --> 00:22:53.350
I only want you to be nice to me.

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:54.920
I see.

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:59.200
But it was really fun, brother!

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:07.770
Ringo was smiling with
the people she cares about...

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:13.370
For so long, that's something I've
wanted more than anything else.

00:23:14.270 --> 00:23:15.300
Brother!

00:23:15.900 --> 00:23:18.710
Ringo wants to come back sometime.

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:20.640
Yeah.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:24.420
My harem always welcomes pretty girls!

00:24:57.670 --> 00:24:59.570
Mafuyu is really mad.

00:24:59.570 --> 00:25:03.440
Key-kun, I'm disappointed that you're
giving her special treatment.

00:25:03.580 --> 00:25:06.810
Is this jealousy?

00:25:06.810 --> 00:25:09.350
I suppose it is.

00:25:09.350 --> 00:25:12.190
Why are you only treating
Magiru-sensei to yakiniku?

00:25:12.190 --> 00:25:13.390
That's it?

00:25:13.390 --> 00:25:15.460
Why did you tell them?

00:25:15.620 --> 00:25:17.490
I didn't tell them anything.

00:25:18.240 --> 00:25:22.530
We were waiting for you
when she came in all happy.

00:25:22.530 --> 00:25:24.270
The pervert's buying me dinner today!

00:25:24.270 --> 00:25:26.470
Yakiniku!

00:25:27.290 --> 00:25:29.070
Do you just say whatever
you're thinking?

00:25:29.070 --> 00:25:31.080
And by pervert,
do you mean me?

00:25:31.080 --> 00:25:32.210
Shut up and let's go.

00:25:35.290 --> 00:25:36.750
What is this picture?

00:25:36.750 --> 00:25:38.580
What did you make your stepsister do?

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:41.420
Th-There's a good reason for this...

00:25:41.420 --> 00:25:42.830
Like what?

00:25:43.970 --> 00:25:47.460
For some reason, I don't
remember what happened next.

00:25:48.280 --> 00:25:51.700
But I realized that harems
can be difficult.

00:25:56.660 --> 00:25:58.600
I'm the heroine next time!

00:25:58.600 --> 00:25:59.320
Halloween?

00:25:59.320 --> 00:26:00.260
No!

00:26:00.260 --> 00:26:01.010
May Queen?

00:26:01.010 --> 00:26:02.620
That's a kind of potato!

00:26:02.620 --> 00:26:03.800
Sexy thing?

00:26:03.800 --> 00:26:04.870
No way.

00:26:04.870 --> 00:26:06.830
Next time: S-Size Hunter

00:26:06.830 --> 00:26:08.640
I'm the star!
